madonna-dei-fusi-buccleuch-head.jpg  <- the image shown in the post

Crop of the finished painting to the Virgin's head and shoulders —
framed on the head/bust (the post's subject, the head study) and keeping
the nude Christ Child's figure out of frame per the site's front-door
policy. The full painting is deliberately NOT kept in this repo for the
same reason; rebuild the crop from the Wikimedia Commons PD-Art source:

  File:Leonardo da Vinci - Madonna of the Yarnwinder, Buccleuch version.jpg
  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Leonardo_da_Vinci_-_Madonna_of_the_Yarnwinder,_Buccleuch_version.jpg
  (5826x7774, Public domain / PD-Art)

  magick <downloaded>.jpg -resize x1600 -crop 720x900+165+70 +repage \
    -quality 88 madonna-dei-fusi-buccleuch-head.jpg
